---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact Kreativ Auto about the site, updates, or general feedback.">
  <div class="container-shell py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="surface p-8 sm:p-10">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">Get in touch</h1>
      <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-base leading-7 text-steel">
        <p>If you want to get in touch about the site, suggest a correction, or point out something that should be improved, use the contact details below.</p>
        <p>For now, the simplest contact method is email:</p>
        <p><a class="font-semibold text-accent underline decoration-accent/30 underline-offset-4" href="mailto:hello@kreativauto.com">hello@kreativauto.com</a></p>
        <p>This site does not provide one-to-one repair advice, but feedback about accuracy, usability, or missing topics is always useful.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
